8 and #108373\r\n\r\nBackports the SDL input driver to 3.x. It follows closely the current implementation on Master.\r\nI built and verified the changes on Linux, Windows and Mac with the Joypad Demo project and the following controllers: PS4, PS5, Switch Pro, Xbox Series X (1914), Xbox One S (1708) and Nacon off brand Xbox 360.\r\n\r\n- [X] : How to correctly handle udev and dbus on Linux? SOWARP_ENABLED is not present on 3.x but there is a libudev-so_wrap. Is a libdbus-so_wrap required to make it work if dbus can't be found on the system? Do we need a thirdparty/linuxbsd_headers as well? I'm a bit out of my depth with understanding how and when which libraries is used from where.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.